{"files": [{"id": 54124400, "name": "Briddon et al_2025_code and data.zip", "size": 27357575, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/54124400", "supplied_md5": "48806b3e870a929cc14c856b27a6dc0d", "computed_md5": "48806b3e870a929cc14c856b27a6dc0d", "mimetype": "application/zip"}], "folder_structure": {}, "authors": [{"id": 19738923, "full_name": "Charlotte L. Briddon", "first_name": "Charlotte L.", "last_name": "Briddon", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": "0000-0003-1882-4297"}, {"id": 19738888, "full_name": "Giulia Ghedini", "first_name": "Giulia", "last_name": "Ghedini", "is_active": true, "url_name": "Giulia_Ghedini", "orcid_id": "0000-0002-5156-2009"}, {"id": 21469219, "full_name": "Aurora Men\u00e9ndez Garc\u00eda", "first_name": "Aurora", "last_name": "Men\u00e9ndez Garc\u00eda", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://figshare.com/articles/dataset/Briddon_et_al_2025_Eco-evolutionary_dynamics_between_multiple_competitors_reduce_phytoplankton_coexistence_but_have_limited_impacts_on_community_productivity/28014971", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">Experimental evolution of three marine phytoplankton species under either intraspecific (monoculture) or interspecific competition (polyculture). These species were then combined based on competition history (monoculture isolates vs. polyculture isolates), to test the consequences of competition regimes on community assembly and functioning.</p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Data collected are:</p><p dir=\"ltr\">species evenness</p><p dir=\"ltr\">cell volume: um3</p><p dir=\"ltr\">cell shape </p><p dir=\"ltr\">population biovolume = density x size: um3/ul </p><p dir=\"ltr\">population photosynthesis P_J_min measured in a 5ml vial</p><p dir=\"ltr\">population respiration DM_J_min measured in a 5 ml vial</p>", "funding": "Junior Leader la Caixa Postdoctoral Fellowship Programme: Shaping